e of this software in the HR Software category. Alternatives BIPO HRMS Bravo 5 (2 reviews) PayScale Activ8 GoCo 4.3 (3 reviews) View All Zoho People Alternatives OrangeHRM 5 (2 reviews) Clarity Wave Info-Tech HR Valiant People HR India View All Keka Alternatives Company Details Get insight into the company details Zoho People and Keka and learn how they operate. Explore the company name, its location, and more! Company Name Zoho Corporation Pvt. Ltd. Headquarter Chennai Company Name Keka Headquarter Hyderabad FAQs Zoho People and Keka cater to which types of businesses? Zoho People is suitable for Startups, SMBs & Enterprises, whereas Keka is suitable for Startups, SMBs & Mid-Market. For what other purposes can Zoho People and Keka be used? Apart from being a HR software, Zoho People can be used as a performance management software, payroll software, time tracking software and employee management system, while Keka can be utilized as a attendance management software, human capital management software and performance management software. What level of customer support can I expect from Zoho People and Keka? Zoho People provides customer support over various channels including email, live support, tickets and training, and Keka provides customer support over phone, email, live support and more. Do Zoho People and Keka offer a free trial? Yes, Zoho People and Keka provide a free trial to its users. Which is the better option between Zoho People and Keka? This depends on various factors, such as your requirements, costs, integrations, customer support, and more. However, based on customer ratings, Keka has an advantage over Zoho People. Zoho People Free Demo Add Product Add Products to Compare Remote 4.7 (7 reviews) Monday ATS 4 (1 review) Oyster Payroll 3 (1 review) Similar Comparisons VS VS Popular Comparisons sumHR HRStop VS ADP Workforce Now Ceridian Dayforce VS Keka SumoPayroll VS Qandle Kitikiti HRM VS Zenefits Justworks VS Keka Darwinbox HR VS Zenefits Rippling V